.TH BUILD-DOCKER 1 "2026-08-31" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler v1.0.0" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler"
.SH NAME
build-docker.sh \- build the Mu2e Shift Scheduler web Docker image
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./scripts/build-docker.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Builds the production container image from
.I docker/web/Dockerfile
(python:3.12-slim, non-root, gunicorn on port 8000). Used standalone for
local image testing or implicitly by
.BR deploy-okd (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR deploy-okd (1),
.BR run-docker-local (1)
